{"title":"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many terms are in the arithmetic sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/5/7d55eb78c27dcce1d6292a41d2bfa434703b275e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dotsc$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b03f8ead3b3da0bd2cbc1a41d8f01630e638f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d792c19ffbd61d37e6b7f89e0e5eb83fcc820ac1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} \\ 21 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)} \\ 24 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} \\ 60 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} \\ 61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10c3f581edf1d01d3f25bbe35ce28b488d1c430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73-13 = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" />, so the amount of terms in the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/5/7d55eb78c27dcce1d6292a41d2bfa434703b275e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dotsc$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b03f8ead3b3da0bd2cbc1a41d8f01630e638f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is the same as in the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/5/7d55eb78c27dcce1d6292a41d2bfa434703b275e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dotsc$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b14ef560acadba8244952e9a8d5481f494445dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$57$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>In this sequence, the terms are the multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> going up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>However, the number 0 must also be included, adding another multiple. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba2aea54fdc49a6bb67bbef45f5b5d0bf1fe60f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the formula for arithmetic sequence's nth term, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/0/800ecaf277aca8c342b67984df84ae2d5468379b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + (n-1)d \\Longrightarrow13 + (n-1)3 =73, \\Longrightarrow n = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"380\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba2aea54fdc49a6bb67bbef45f5b5d0bf1fe60f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Minus each of the terms by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to make the the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/6/8f605f1fb00f809f0990b75fa9ee7a4174a66485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 , 4 , 7,..., 61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afa589297d277f69fbd121ec94b60ec7089a2850.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{61-1}{3}=20, 20 + 1 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba2aea54fdc49a6bb67bbef45f5b5d0bf1fe60f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtract each of the terms by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to make the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/4591a48cff3f51a0afa26cb3cb9c0e70262c80ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 , 6 , 9,..., 60, 63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" />. Then divide the each term in the sequence by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/b/4ab0e0387eabf7b3323bd935d4c13c2519fd6237.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 3,..., 20, 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" />. Now it is clear to see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms in the sequence.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba2aea54fdc49a6bb67bbef45f5b5d0bf1fe60f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/i7ItueJ6K8E\">https://youtu.be/i7ItueJ6K8E</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fcWPfgKeCmA\">https://youtu.be/fcWPfgKeCmA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A\">2015 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><